@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
skinparam wrapWidth 180
<style>
root { FontName Helvetica; FontSize 14; FontColor #1F2937 }
element { BackgroundColor #F1F5F9; LineColor #475569; LineThickness 1.2; RoundCorner 6 }
arrow   { LineColor #475569; LineThickness 1.2; FontSize 12; MaximumWidth 180 }
note    { BackgroundColor #FFF7E0; LineColor #B45309; FontSize 12; MaximumWidth 260 }
title   { FontSize 18; FontStyle bold }
legend  { FontSize 12; BackgroundColor white; LineColor #CBD5E1; MaximumWidth 360 }
</style>
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 60
hide empty members
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam groupInheritance 2

title Data model (UML class diagram): persisted entities of the municipal report system and their dependents

abstract class User <<persistent>> {
  userId: Long {id}
  name, lastName, phoneNumber
  credentials: Credentials
}
class Credentials <<embeddable>> {
  email {unique}
  password
}
class Citizen
class MunicipalOperator
class Report <<persistent>> {
  reportId: Long {id}
  title, description
  category: ReportCategory
  dateReport, imageAttached
  currentStatusName: String
  citizenEditable: boolean
}
class Location <<embeddable>> {
  city, cap, street
  streetNumber, municipalArea
}
class StatusUpdate <<persistent>> {
  updateId: Long {id}
  updateDate
  newStatus: String
}
class InternalNote <<persistent>> {
  noteId: Long {id}
  text
  dateEntry
}
class Notification <<persistent>> {
  notificationId: Long {id}
  sentDate, message
  notifiedStatus
}
class ReportService
class UserService
class PersistenceService {
  save(o), update(o)
  findById(cls, id)
  findByFields(cls, map)
}

User <|-- Citizen
User <|-- MunicipalOperator
User *-- "1" Credentials
Report *-- "1" Location
Citizen "1" <-- "0..*" Report : reporter
MunicipalOperator "0..1" <-- "0..*" Report : assignee
Report "1" *-- "0..*" StatusUpdate : history
Report "1" *-- "0..*" InternalNote : notes
MunicipalOperator "1" <-- "0..*" StatusUpdate : author
MunicipalOperator "1" <-- "0..*" InternalNote : author
Report "1" <-- "0..*" Notification : about
Citizen "1" <-- "0..*" Notification : recipient

ReportService ..> Report : reads, writes
ReportService ..> Notification : creates, reads
ReportService ..> InternalNote : creates, reads
ReportService ..> StatusUpdate : reads
UserService ..> User : registers, finds
ReportService ..> PersistenceService : persists via
UserService ..> PersistenceService : persists via

note bottom of Report
  category (enum ReportCategory): BROKEN_STREETLIGHT,
  DAMAGED_ROAD, ABANDONED_WASTE, GENERAL_HAZARD,
  DAMAGED_STREET_FURNITURE.
  Status text: submitted, assigned, in_progress,
  resolved; state objects are rebuilt on load.
  Location and Credentials columns sit in the
  reports and users tables; Citizen and operator
  share table users (discriminator role).
end note
note bottom of PersistenceService
  Services are called by the Control classes;
  the GUIs reach them only through Control.
  Store: MySQL reports_db via Hibernate
  (hbm2ddl update).
end note
legend bottom
  Profile declared here: <<persistent>> = JPA entity (own table), <<embeddable>> = columns embedded in the owner's table.
  Solid arrows = foreign-key associations; dashed = code dependency.
endlegend
@enduml
